    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 50,
      "npc" : "Eclage Guard",
      "text" : "[Eclage Guard]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 51,
      "npc" : "Eclage Guard",
      "text" : "How may I help you?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 53,
      "npc" : "Eclage Guard",
      "text" : "What's that teleporter?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 53,
      "npc" : "Eclage Guard",
      "text" : "Why is it so crowded in here?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 53,
      "npc" : "Eclage Guard",
      "text" : "Demon God's hideout?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 53,
      "npc" : "Eclage Guard",
      "text" : "Goodbye."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 55,
      "npc" : "Eclage Guard",
      "text" : "[Eclage Guard]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 56,
      "npc" : "Eclage Guard",
      "text" : "It's connected to the recently discovered hideout the of Demon God."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 57,
      "npc" : "Eclage Guard",
      "text" : "It's scientifically designed to send its user directly to the Dimensional Crack where his hideout is."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 59,
      "npc" : "Eclage Guard",
      "text" : "[Eclage Guard]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 60,
      "npc" : "Eclage Guard",
      "text" : "Many a warrior already left to the hideout."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 61,
      "npc" : "Eclage Guard",
      "text" : "So long as Morocc exists, Yggdrasil is not safe. I'm going to join the Expedition."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 64,
      "npc" : "Eclage Guard",
      "text" : "[Eclage Guard]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 65,
      "npc" : "Eclage Guard",
      "text" : "It turns out Demon God ran from Morocc to hide out in our dimension."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 66,
      "npc" : "Eclage Guard",
      "text" : "He has to be dealt with, either banished back to his realm or destroyed."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 68,
      "npc" : "Eclage Guard",
      "text" : "[Eclage Guard]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 69,
      "npc" : "Eclage Guard",
      "text" : "If you want to join the Expedition to defeat the Demon God, then use this teleporter."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 70,
      "npc" : "Eclage Guard",
      "text" : "It'll send you directly to the Expedition Camp."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 73,
      "npc" : "Eclage Guard",
      "text" : "[Eclage Guard]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 74,
      "npc" : "Eclage Guard",
      "text" : "You know the Dimensional Crack, don't you? Recently it's been revealed that the Crack is made up of dimensional passageways."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 75,
      "npc" : "Eclage Guard",
      "text" : "We can now use those passageways to explore inside the Crack."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 77,
      "npc" : "Eclage Guard",
      "text" : "[Eclage Guard]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 78,
      "npc" : "Eclage Guard",
      "text" : "Originally the Crack was created by the Demon God to aid in his escape,"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 79,
      "npc" : "Eclage Guard",
      "text" : "so it'd been thought investigating the Crack could locate him."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 81,
      "npc" : "Eclage Guard",
      "text" : "[Eclage Guard]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 82,
      "npc" : "Eclage Guard",
      "text" : "And it was; finally his hideout has been discovered."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 83,
      "npc" : "Eclage Guard",
      "text" : "His traces and his demon soldiers are sighted mainly around the giant hill in the center."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 85,
      "npc" : "Eclage Guard",
      "text" : "[Eclage Guard]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 86,
      "npc" : "Eclage Guard",
      "text" : "If you want more details, then you should visit the actual site."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 87,
      "npc" : "Eclage Guard",
      "text" : "Just use the teleporter over there."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 90,
      "npc" : "Eclage Guard",
      "text" : "[Eclage Guard]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 91,
      "npc" : "Eclage Guard",
      "text" : "May Yggdrasil bless you."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 98,
      "npc" : "Combat Laphine",
      "text" : "[Combat Laphine]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 99,
      "npc" : "Combat Laphine",
      "text" : "I'm nervous."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 104,
      "npc" : "Combat Laphine",
      "text" : "[Combat Laphine]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 105,
      "npc" : "Combat Laphine",
      "text" : "I hope I can return in one piece."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 110,
      "npc" : "Combat Laphine",
      "text" : "[Combat Laphine]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 111,
      "npc" : "Combat Laphine",
      "text" : "Hmm..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 115,
      "npc" : "Combat Laphine",
      "text" : "[Combat Laphine]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 116,
      "npc" : "Combat Laphine",
      "text" : "Shush."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 121,
      "npc" : "Combat Laphine",
      "text" : "[Combat Laphine]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 122,
      "npc" : "Combat Laphine",
      "text" : "Mwa hah hah, it's time for me to shine!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 127,
      "npc" : "Combat Laphine",
      "text" : "[Combat Laphine]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 128,
      "npc" : "Combat Laphine",
      "text" : "I must have been out of my mind when I decided to join the army. Sigh, why does the Door to Verities have to be so high up there?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 133,
      "npc" : "Commander Laphine",
      "text" : "[Commander Laphine]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 134,
      "npc" : "Commander Laphine",
      "text" : "Evil must be nipped in the butt."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 135,
      "npc" : "Commander Laphine",
      "text" : "You're unexpected visitors from the Midgard Continent."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 137,
      "npc" : "Commander Laphine",
      "text" : "[Commander Laphine]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 138,
      "npc" : "Commander Laphine",
      "text" : "If you  are the cause doom to ourselves OR Yggdrasil, then we won't hesitate to fight you."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 173,
      "npc" : "Magic Scholar Lemony",
      "text" : "[Lemony]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 174,
      "npc" : "Magic Scholar Lemony",
      "text" : "Did you read the latest issue of the Door to Verities magazine?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 175,
      "npc" : "Magic Scholar Lemony",
      "text" : "Was Avant's new teleporter really featured in it?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 177,
      "npc" : "Magic Scholar Lemony",
      "text" : "[Armandi]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 178,
      "npc" : "Magic Scholar Lemony",
      "text" : "Yes, just the basic principles and the information relevant to the Humans."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 179,
      "npc" : "Magic Scholar Lemony",
      "text" : "I didn't quite understand it all."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 181,
      "npc" : "Magic Scholar Lemony",
      "text" : "[Lemony]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 182,
      "npc" : "Magic Scholar Lemony",
      "text" : "I wonder if this means Avant has finally decided to pursue his interest in research activities."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 184,
      "npc" : "Magic Scholar Lemony",
      "text" : "[Lemony]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 185,
      "npc" : "Magic Scholar Lemony",
      "text" : "Hey, Human."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 186,
      "npc" : "Magic Scholar Lemony",
      "text" : "Were you eavesdropping on us? Well, though it wasn't like we're discussing secrets."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 188,
      "npc" : "Magic Scholar Lemony",
      "text" : "[Lemony]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 189,
      "npc" : "Magic Scholar Lemony",
      "text" : "Oh, right. Are you too going there?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 190,
      "npc" : "Magic Scholar Lemony",
      "text" : "You know, the hideout of the Demon God who created some of the Space Time Dimensional Cracks has recently been discovered."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 192,
      "npc" : "Magic Scholar Lemony",
      "text" : "[Lemony]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 193,
      "npc" : "Magic Scholar Lemony",
      "text" : "If you're curious, then use that teleporter to the hideout over there."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 194,
      "npc" : "Magic Scholar Lemony",
      "text" : "There will be quite a spectacle to watch."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 195,
      "npc" : "Magic Scholar Lemony",
      "text" : "Oh, just so you know, you might be throwing away your life. *Giggle*"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 197,
      "npc" : "Magic Scholar Lemony",
      "text" : "[Armandi]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 198,
      "npc" : "Magic Scholar Lemony",
      "text" : "Lemony, you really need to work on improving your personality."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 199,
      "npc" : "Magic Scholar Lemony",
      "text" : "Tsk, tsk."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 204,
      "npc" : "Magic Scholar Armandi",
      "text" : "[Armandi]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 205,
      "npc" : "Magic Scholar Armandi",
      "text" : "I hope the Interdimensional Device won't take a heavy toll on the world."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 206,
      "npc" : "Magic Scholar Armandi",
      "text" : "By the way, Avant never fails to amaze me."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 208,
      "npc" : "Magic Scholar Armandi",
      "text" : "[Lemony]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 209,
      "npc" : "Magic Scholar Armandi",
      "text" : "Ack, I hate that guy."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 211,
      "npc" : "Magic Scholar Armandi",
      "text" : "[Armandi]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 212,
      "npc" : "Magic Scholar Armandi",
      "text" : "Avant may be repulsive,"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 213,
      "npc" : "Magic Scholar Armandi",
      "text" : "but he's the best at what he does."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 215,
      "npc" : "Magic Scholar Armandi",
      "text" : "[Lemony]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 216,
      "npc" : "Magic Scholar Armandi",
      "text" : "That, I agree."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 217,
      "npc" : "Magic Scholar Armandi",
      "text" : "Only he could pull off this kind of teleporter."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 218,
      "npc" : "Magic Scholar Armandi",
      "text" : "Why is he helping the Mayor, anyway?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 220,
      "npc" : "Magic Scholar Armandi",
      "text" : "[Armandi]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 221,
      "npc" : "Magic Scholar Armandi",
      "text" : "When I asked him, he mumbled something about repentance."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 222,
      "npc" : "Magic Scholar Armandi",
      "text" : "I can only guess it has something to do with the Mayor's birth."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 224,
      "npc" : "Magic Scholar Armandi",
      "text" : "[Armandi]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 225,
      "npc" : "Magic Scholar Armandi",
      "text" : "I wanted to ask more, but he looked down his nose at me."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 226,
      "npc" : "Magic Scholar Armandi",
      "text" : "Sigh, it's unfair such a jerk is considered the best in magical science."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 228,
      "npc" : "Magic Scholar Armandi",
      "text" : "[Lemony]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 229,
      "npc" : "Magic Scholar Armandi",
      "text" : "You can always study hard to beat him."
    }
  ]
}